L = ["# Prayog STEM lab kit: manufacturing manual", "", "> **Status: firmware and analysis tools tested on the host; the hub board is " + ("**order-ready (all automatic checks pass)**" if ok and bi["rdy"]["order_ready"] else "**not yet released** (routing/verification unfinished: do not send to a fab)") + "; no hardware built; sensors uncalibrated; syllabus mapping and school procurement route unverified.**", "",
     "## 1. What is made", "", "A hub board (ATmega328P at 16 MHz, CH340C USB-serial with auto-reset, USB-C, eight 3-pin sensor sockets A0-A7, photogate port on D2, ultrasonic port on D4/D5, reaction pad button D8 + LED D7) plus **12 plug-in sensor modules** and 20 experiments with worksheets and a teacher guide. Firmware streams CSV at 115200 baud; Python tools analyse data offline.", "",
     "| Deliverable | Where |", "|---|---|", f"| Hub PCB | `{rel}/` |", "| Firmware | `products/03-prayog/release/prayog.hex` (9.6 KB flash, 434 B RAM), source `products/03-prayog/firmware/`, 40 sensor-library checks |", "| Analysis tools | `products/03-prayog/tools/prayog_tools.py` (11 of 11 pass on simulated data) |", "| Experiments | `products/03-prayog/docs/experiments.md` (20) |", "| Cost model | `products/03-prayog/docs/kit_cost.txt` (BOM Rs 2,580 at about 1,000 kits) |", ""]
